         <head>THE MEMOIRS OF CASANOVA</head>
         <author>By Jacques Casanova de Seingalt</author>
         <pb/>
         <div type="div1">
            <head>Quotes and Images from the Memoirs of Jacques Casanova de Seingalt</head>
            <p rend="justify">cas-venetian.jpg (114K)<lb/>
            </p>
